// BiasedDoom / GZDoom 4.15+ controller haptics stubs.
// Separate SNDINFO.* lump so UZDoom 4.14 / ZScript 4.5.0 pin does not parse $rumble
// in the main SNDINFO.txt. Engines that support haptics auto-merge this lump.

$rumble player/dashready SUBTLE
$rumble LIGHTON NONE
$rumble IronSights NONE
$rumble MP4DGT LIGHT
$rumble MP4DGG LIGHT
$rumble MP4DG2 LIGHT
$rumble RIFCL_CK LIGHT
$rumble Glorykill MEDIUM
$rumble Health_Med SUBTLE
$rumble items/armor/Sshard SUBTLE
$rumble Health_Small SUBTLE
$rumble CLAP LIGHT
$rumble blooddrop2 NONE
$rumble demon/melee LIGHT
$rumble BLOOOD LIGHT
$rumble gore/headshot MEDIUM
$rumble nashgore/gibsmall LIGHT
$rumble blooddrop NONE
